Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:33:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 43/65] P5d: bind reset, toggle crouch, flashlight, health
 clamp, reload anim.

Full codmod bind reset path, sticky crouch on C with jump auto-stand,
client flashlight on L, packs hard-capped at cod_maxHealth, and reload
always restarts WEAP_RELOAD1 (clears attack weapAnimTimer).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
